div class=\"elementor-form-fields-wrapper elementor-labels-above\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-text elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-name elementor-col-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input size=\"1\" type=\"text\" name=\"form_fields[name]\" id=\"form-field-name\" class=\"elementor-field elementor-size-sm  elementor-field-textual\" placeholder=\"Name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-email elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-email elementor-col-100 elementor-field-required\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input size=\"1\" type=\"email\" name=\"form_fields[email]\" id=\"form-field-email\" class=\"elementor-field elementor-size-sm  elementor-field-textual\" placeholder=\"Email\" required=\"required\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-text elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-field_18f1960 elementor-col-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input size=\"1\" type=\"text\" name=\"form_fields[field_18f1960]\" id=\"form-field-field_18f1960\" class=\"elementor-field elementor-size-sm  elementor-field-textual\" placeholder=\"Your  Website (Optional)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-type-submit elementor-col-100 e-form__buttons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"elementor-button elementor-size-md\" type=\"submit\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Report Audit</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ae7c32 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4ae7c32\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d4c548 elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9d4c548\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2b83ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e2b83ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-section-id=\"1xgi74u\" data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"193\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"191\">What is web design and digital marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"393\">Web design and digital marketing is a combined strategy where a business creates a user-friendly website and promotes it using SEO, ads, and content marketing to attract and convert customers online.</p><hr data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"398\" /><p data-section-id=\"164t6ok\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"452\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"450\">What are the 4 types of digital marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"611\">The four main types of digital marketing are Search Engine Optimization (SEO), Pay-Per-Click advertising (PPC), Social Media Marketing, and Content Marketing.</p><hr data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"616\" /><p data-section-id=\"16395g7\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"670\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"668\">What are the 7 types of digital marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"811\">The seven types include SEO, PPC, Social Media Marketing, Content Marketing, Email Marketing, Affiliate Marketing, and Influencer Marketing.</p><hr data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"816\" /><p data-section-id=\"t70evd\" data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"861\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"859\">What is SEO in digital marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1017\">SEO (Search Engine Optimization) is the process of improving a website’s visibility on search engines like Google to increase organic traffic and rankings.</p><hr data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1022\" /><p data-section-id=\"tsnz49\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1079\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1077\">What skills are needed for digital marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1243\">Key digital marketing skills include SEO, content writing, data analysis, social media management, paid advertising, communication, and basic web design knowledge.</p><hr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1248\" /><p data-section-id=\"dm0pl5\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1303\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1301\">What are the 5 stages of digital marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1431\">The five stages are Awareness, Consideration, Conversion, Retention, and Advocacy, guiding customers from discovery to loyalty.</p><hr data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1436\" /><p data-section-id=\"9brs25\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1480\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1478\">What are the 5 C’s of marketing?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1623\">The 5 C’s of marketing are Company, Customers, Competitors, Collaborators, and Climate, used to analyze business strategy and market position.</p><hr data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1628\" /><p data-section-id=\"8dgmk6\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1669\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1667\">Can ChatGPT create a website?</strong></span></p><p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1827\">ChatGPT can help generate website code, content, and structure ideas, but you still need a developer or website builder to design, launch, and host the site.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f3539c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9f3539c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6769cf elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-laptop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"f6769cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
